        "created_at": "2023-09-07T18:43:07.923Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just bought it and read through; looks cool!</p>\n<p>I do have a question about the RevoCorp Loaders, though.<br>\nThe Loaders ‘combine their conditional successes to succeed when taking twists’. What does that mean? Is that only applying to the “if they get the Succeed With Major Twist, they can have three loaders count as success” ability, or does it also apply on minor twists?</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2023-09-07T18:43:07.923Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
